Write changelog digest versions for these audiences: {{ $json.targetAudiences.join(', ') }}

Product: {{ $json.productName }}
Version: {{ $json.releaseVersion || 'not specified' }}
Release date: {{ $json.releaseDate }}
Period covered: {{ $json.periodCovered || 'this release' }}
Brand voice: {{ $json.brandVoice }}

Changes ({{ $json.changes.length }} total):
{{ $json.changes.map(c=>c.id+' ['+c.type+']['+c.impact+'] '+c.title+': '+c.description+(c.affectedAreas.length?' (affects: '+c.affectedAreas.join('+')+')':'')+(c.ticketRef?' ['+c.ticketRef+']':'')).join('\n\n') }}

Return JSON with a key for each requested audience:
{"customers":{"email_subject":"","preview_text":"","headline":"benefit-led headline for the release","intro":"1-2 sentences that frame this release for users","highlights":[{"title":"user-facing change title","benefit":"what this means for the user — outcome focused","change_type":"new|improved|fixed"}],"closing":"1-2 sentences: what to do next or where to learn more"},"internal":{"subject":"","summary":"what shipped and key watch-outs","changes_with_notes":[{"id":"","title":"","implementation_note":"anything support/CS should know","watch_for":""}],"rollout_notes":""},"developers":{"subject":"","summary":"","api_changes":[{"change":"","migration_required":false,"migration_steps":"or null"}],"deprecations":[]},"executives":{"subject":"","one_liner":"one sentence: what shipped and why it matters for the business","key_wins":["2-3 business-relevant highlights"],"metrics_to_watch":[]}}
